From fd27653b490993a878eb3e445937d1ee19171345 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pauleveritt <pauleveritt@me.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:54:58 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] mellum: ssd expert streaming

Stream Q8_0 and MXFP4 experts through bounded slab slots and per-layer
address tables. Gate stopped decode work, overlap reads with resumed encode,
and group prefill chunks by layer. Preserve the resident decode fusions.
Carry failed-read recovery, gate-overflow, stop-scratch and Metal tensor
lifetime regressions alongside the host scheduler and native parity tests.

Add the standalone C measurement driver and effective-slot, RSS and Metal
allocation metrics. Keep the Python measurement orchestrator and C frontend
cases out of this topic. Physical 16 GB and 8 GB acceptance remains pending.

Reference: pauleveritt/ds4-mellum d2d9338b9b28bd8a51b0f938f2dc1dea33954493
Upstream: not offered, fork only
Retire-when: upstream supports Mellum SSD expert streaming
